Library for reading in values from the ADS1256 analog to digital converter (ADC)
on the Waveshare DA/AD board:

  http://www.waveshare.com/product/mini-pc/raspberry-pi/expansions/high-precision-ad-da-board.htm

The chip is connected over SPI, and this library depends on the bcm2835 library:

  http://www.airspayce.com/mikem/bcm2835/



